Package: do.correct
Title: Dissolved Oxygen Unit Conversion, Saturation Calculations, and QC Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris", "McBride", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chris@limnotrack.com")
Description: Tools for dissolved oxygen data processing in profiling and
    fixed-depth sensor platforms. Includes unit conversions between mg/L
    and percent saturation using the Garcia & Gordon (1992) / Benson &
    Krause (1984) equations with full pressure and salinity correction.
    Sensor-specific functions for Ponsel OptoD and In-Situ RDO Pro.
    Optional barometric pressure retrieval from Open-Meteo API for
    accurate altitude/pressure correction. Gain drift detection and
    correction utilities for long-term DO sensor deployments.
